{"seq":2,"slug":"window-functions","title":"窗口函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/advanced-queries/window-functions","wordCount":763,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"窗口函数\">窗口函数</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>窗口函数（Window Functions）是 SQL 中最强大的分析工具，它在不改变结果集行数的前提下，为每一行计算基于一组相关行（&quot;窗口&quot;）的聚合值。与 GROUP BY 不同，窗口函数不折叠行——原始行保持不变，计算结果作为新列附加。这使得窗口函数能够同时展示明细数据和聚合数据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[窗口函数] --&gt; B[PARTITION BY]&#10;    A --&gt; C[ORDER BY]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Frame 子句]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; B1[按指定列分组]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[组内排序]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[ROWS]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[RANGE]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[GROUPS]&#10;&#10;    subgraph 函数类型&#10;        E[排名函数 - ROW_NUMBER / RANK / DENSE_RANK]&#10;        F[聚合函数 - SUM / AVG / COUNT]&#10;        G[偏移函数 - LAG / LEAD / FIRST_VALUE / LAST_VALUE]&#10;        H[分布函数 - PERCENT_RANK / CUME_DIST / NTILE]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[窗口函数] --&gt; B[PARTITION BY]\n    A --&gt; C[ORDER BY]\n    A --&gt; D[Frame 子句]\n\n    B --&gt; B1[按指定列分组]\n    C --&gt; C1[组内排序]\n    D --&gt; D1[ROWS]\n    D --&gt; D2[RANGE]\n    D --&gt; D3[GROUPS]\n\n    subgraph 函数类型\n        E[排名函数 - ROW_NUMBER / RANK / DENSE_RANK]\n        F[聚合函数 - SUM / AVG / COUNT]\n        G[偏移函数 - LAG / LEAD / FIRST_VALUE / LAST_VALUE]\n        H[分布函数 - PERCENT_RANK / CUME_DIST / NTILE]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数类型</th>\n<th>代表函数</th>\n<th>是否需要 ORDER BY</th>\n<th>是否受 Frame 影响</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>排名函数</td>\n<td>ROW_NUMBER, RANK</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>编号、去重、分页</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚合函数</td>\n<td>SUM, AVG, COUNT</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>累计值、移动平均</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏移函数</td>\n<td>LAG, LEAD</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>环比、同比、前后行对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布函数</td>\n<td>NTILE, PERCENT_RANK</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>分桶、百分位排名</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"排名函数\">排名函数</h2><p>排名函数为分区内的每一行分配一个序号。三个核心排名函数的区别在于处理并列值的方式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const rankingFunctions = `&#10;-- ROW_NUMBER：严格递增，并列值也不重复&#10;-- RANK：并列值相同排名，后续跳号&#10;-- DENSE_RANK：并列值相同排名，后续不跳号&#10;SELECT &#10;    department_id,&#10;    employee_name,&#10;    salary,&#10;    ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY department_id ORDER BY salary DESC) AS row_num,&#10;    RANK()       OVER (PARTITION BY department_id ORDER BY salary DESC) AS rank_val,&#10;    DENSE_RANK() OVER (PARTITION BY department_id ORDER BY salary DESC) AS dense_rank_val&#10;FROM employees;&#10;&#10;-- 示例结果（department_id = 1）：&#10;-- salary  row_num  rank_val  dense_rank_val&#10;-- 10000   1        1         1&#10;-- 10000   2        1         1&#10;-- 8000    3        3         2    ← RANK 跳号，DENSE_RANK 不跳&#10;-- 7000    4        4         3&#10;&#10;-- 每组取 Top N（经典模式）&#10;SELECT * FROM (&#10;    SELECT &#10;        p.*,&#10;        ROW_NUMBER() OVER (&#10;            PARTITION BY category_id &#10;            ORDER BY sales_count DESC&#10;        ) AS rn&#10;    FROM products p&#10;) ranked&#10;WHERE rn &lt;= 3;&#10;&#10;-- 去重保留最新记录&#10;DELETE FROM events&#10;WHERE event_id NOT IN (&#10;    SELECT event_id FROM (&#10;        SELECT event_id, ROW_NUMBER() OVER (&#10;            PARTITION BY user_id, event_type &#10;            ORDER BY created_at DESC&#10;        ) AS rn&#10;        FROM events&#10;    ) t WHERE rn = 1&#10;);&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> rankingFunctions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- ROW_NUMBER：严格递增，并列值也不重复</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- RANK：并列值相同排名，后续跳号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- DENSE_RANK：并列值相同排名，后续不跳号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    department_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    employee_name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    salary,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY department_id ORDER BY salary DESC) AS row_num,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    RANK()       OVER (PARTITION BY department_id ORDER BY salary DESC) AS rank_val,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    DENSE_RANK() OVER (PARTITION BY department_id ORDER BY salary DESC) AS dense_rank_val</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM employees;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 示例结果（department_id = 1）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- salary  row_num  rank_val  dense_rank_val</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 10000   1        1         1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 10000   2        1         1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 8000    3        3         2    ← RANK 跳号，DENSE_RANK 不跳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 7000    4        4         3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 每组取 Top N（经典模式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        p.*,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        ROW_NUMBER() OVER (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            PARTITION BY category_id </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            ORDER BY sales_count DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        ) AS rn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM products p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">) ranked</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE rn &#x3C;= 3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 去重保留最新记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DELETE FROM events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE event_id NOT IN (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT event_id FROM (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        SELECT event_id, ROW_NUMBER() OVER (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            PARTITION BY user_id, event_type </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            ORDER BY created_at DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        ) AS rn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        FROM events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ) t WHERE rn = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>并列处理</th>\n<th>值示例 (3个并列第1)</th>\n<th>常用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ROW_NUMBER</td>\n<td>不并列</td>\n<td>1, 2, 3, 4</td>\n<td>分页、去重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RANK</td>\n<td>并列+跳号</td>\n<td>1, 1, 1, 4</td>\n<td>竞赛排名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DENSE_RANK</td>\n<td>并列+不跳号</td>\n<td>1, 1, 1, 2</td>\n<td>密集排名、分层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"聚合窗口函数\">聚合窗口函数</h2><p>聚合函数（SUM、AVG、COUNT 等）作为窗口函数使用时，可以计算累计值、移动平均等分析指标。Frame 子句控制参与计算的行范围。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const aggregateWindows = `&#10;-- 累计求和（Running Total）&#10;SELECT &#10;    order_date,&#10;    amount,&#10;    SUM(amount) OVER (ORDER BY order_date) AS running_total,&#10;    SUM(amount) OVER (&#10;        ORDER BY order_date &#10;        ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW&#10;    ) AS cumulative_sum&#10;FROM daily_sales;&#10;&#10;-- 7 天移动平均&#10;SELECT &#10;    date,&#10;    revenue,&#10;    AVG(revenue) OVER (&#10;        ORDER BY date &#10;        ROWS BETWEEN 6 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW&#10;    ) AS moving_avg_7d&#10;FROM daily_metrics;&#10;&#10;-- 分区内占比&#10;SELECT &#10;    department_id,&#10;    employee_name,&#10;    salary,&#10;    SUM(salary) OVER (PARTITION BY department_id) AS dept_total,&#10;    ROUND(salary * 100.0 / SUM(salary) OVER (PARTITION BY department_id), 2) AS pct&#10;FROM employees;&#10;&#10;-- 累计计数 + 累计去重计数&#10;SELECT &#10;    order_date,&#10;    user_id,&#10;    COUNT(*) OVER (ORDER BY order_date) AS cumulative_orders,&#10;    COUNT(DISTINCT user_id) OVER (ORDER BY order_date) AS cumulative_users&#10;FROM orders;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> aggregateWindows</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 累计求和（Running Total）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    order_date,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SUM(amount) OVER (ORDER BY order_date) AS running_total,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SUM(amount) OVER (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        ORDER BY order_date </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ) AS cumulative_sum</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM daily_sales;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 7 天移动平均</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    date,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    revenue,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    AVG(revenue) OVER (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        ORDER BY date </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        ROWS BETWEEN 6 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ) AS moving_avg_7d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM daily_metrics;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 分区内占比</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    department_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    employee_name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    salary,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SUM(salary) OVER (PARTITION BY department_id) AS dept_total,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ROUND(salary * 100.0 / SUM(salary) OVER (PARTITION BY department_id), 2) AS pct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM employees;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 累计计数 + 累计去重计数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    order_date,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(*) OVER (ORDER BY order_date) AS cumulative_orders,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(DISTINCT user_id) OVER (ORDER BY order_date) AS cumulative_users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM orders;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Frame 子句的三种模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Frame 模式</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>默认范围</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ROWS</td>\n<td>物理行数</td>\n<td>UNBOUNDED PRECEDING TO CURRENT ROW</td>\n<td>精确 N 行滑动窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RANGE</td>\n<td>值范围</td>\n<td>UNBOUNDED PRECEDING TO CURRENT ROW</td>\n<td>值域范围聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GROUPS</td>\n<td>分组数</td>\n<td>UNBOUNDED PRECEDING TO CURRENT ROW</td>\n<td>按 peer group 聚合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"偏移函数\">偏移函数</h2><p>LAG 和 LEAD 访问当前行的前/后行数据，无需自连接。FIRST_VALUE 和 LAST_VALUE 获取窗口中的首/末值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const offsetFunctions = `&#10;-- 环比增长率（Month-over-Month）&#10;SELECT &#10;    month,&#10;    revenue,&#10;    LAG(revenue, 1) OVER (ORDER BY month) AS prev_month_revenue,&#10;    ROUND(&#10;        (revenue - LAG(revenue, 1) OVER (ORDER BY month)) * 100.0 &#10;        / LAG(revenue, 1) OVER (ORDER BY month), &#10;        2&#10;    ) AS mom_growth_pct&#10;FROM monthly_revenue;&#10;&#10;-- 同比增长率（Year-over-Year）&#10;SELECT &#10;    month,&#10;    revenue,&#10;    LAG(revenue, 12) OVER (ORDER BY month) AS prev_year_revenue,&#10;    ROUND(&#10;        (revenue - LAG(revenue, 12) OVER (ORDER BY month)) * 100.0 &#10;        / NULLIF(LAG(revenue, 12) OVER (ORDER BY month), 0), &#10;        2&#10;    ) AS yoy_growth_pct&#10;FROM monthly_revenue;&#10;&#10;-- 连续事件间隔计算&#10;SELECT &#10;    event_id,&#10;    user_id,&#10;    created_at,&#10;    LAG(created_at) OVER (PARTITION BY user_id ORDER BY created_at) AS prev_event_at,&#10;    created_at - LAG(created_at) OVER (&#10;        PARTITION BY user_id ORDER BY created_at&#10;    ) AS time_gap&#10;FROM user_events;&#10;&#10;-- FIRST_VALUE / LAST_VALUE&#10;SELECT &#10;    product_id,&#10;    sale_date,&#10;    price,&#10;    FIRST_VALUE(price) OVER (&#10;        PARTITION BY product_id ORDER BY sale_date&#10;    ) AS first_price,&#10;    LAST_VALUE(price) OVER (&#10;        PARTITION BY product_id ORDER BY sale_date&#10;        ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND UNBOUNDED FOLLOWING&#10;    ) AS last_price&#10;FROM product_prices;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> offsetFunctions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 环比增长率（Month-over-Month）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    month,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    revenue,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    LAG(revenue, 1) OVER (ORDER BY month) AS prev_month_revenue,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ROUND(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        (revenue - LAG(revenue, 1) OVER (ORDER BY month)) * 100.0 </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        / LAG(revenue, 1) OVER (ORDER BY month), </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ) AS mom_growth_pct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM monthly_revenue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 同比增长率（Year-over-Year）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    month,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    revenue,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    LAG(revenue, 12) OVER (ORDER BY month) AS prev_year_revenue,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ROUND(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        (revenue - LAG(revenue, 12) OVER (ORDER BY month)) * 100.0 </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        / NULLIF(LAG(revenue, 12) OVER (ORDER BY month), 0), </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ) AS yoy_growth_pct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM monthly_revenue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 连续事件间隔计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    event_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    created_at,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    LAG(created_at) OVER (PARTITION BY user_id ORDER BY created_at) AS prev_event_at,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    created_at - LAG(created_at) OVER (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        PARTITION BY user_id ORDER BY created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ) AS time_gap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM user_events;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- FIRST_VALUE / LAST_VALUE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    product_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    sale_date,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    price,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FIRST_VALUE(price) OVER (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        PARTITION BY product_id ORDER BY sale_date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ) AS first_price,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    LAST_VALUE(price) OVER (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        PARTITION BY product_id ORDER BY sale_date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND UNBOUNDED FOLLOWING</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ) AS last_price</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM product_prices;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 LAST_VALUE 的陷阱：默认 Frame 是 <code>ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW</code>，所以 LAST_VALUE 返回的是当前行的值而非分区末尾。要获取真正的末尾值，必须显式指定 <code>ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND UNBOUNDED FOLLOWING</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"named-window-与性能\">NAMED WINDOW 与性能</h2><p>当多个窗口函数使用相同的分区和排序时，可以使用 WINDOW 子句定义命名窗口，提升可读性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const namedWindow = `&#10;SELECT &#10;    department_id,&#10;    employee_name,&#10;    salary,&#10;    ROW_NUMBER() OVER w AS row_num,&#10;    RANK() OVER w AS rank_val,&#10;    SUM(salary) OVER w AS running_salary,&#10;    AVG(salary) OVER w AS running_avg&#10;FROM employees&#10;WINDOW w AS (PARTITION BY department_id ORDER BY salary DESC);&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> namedWindow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    department_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    employee_name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    salary,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ROW_NUMBER() OVER w AS row_num,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    RANK() OVER w AS rank_val,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SUM(salary) OVER w AS running_salary,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    AVG(salary) OVER w AS running_avg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM employees</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WINDOW w AS (PARTITION BY department_id ORDER BY salary DESC);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>窗口函数的性能关键在于排序。每个不同的 PARTITION BY + ORDER BY 组合都需要一次排序操作。优化策略包括：为窗口函数的排序列创建索引，合并相同分区和排序的窗口定义，以及控制分区大小避免内存溢出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>窗口函数在不折叠行的前提下计算分区内的聚合值，同时展示明细和汇总</li>\n<li>ROW_NUMBER / RANK / DENSE_RANK 三个排名函数在处理并列值时行为不同</li>\n<li>聚合窗口函数通过 Frame 子句控制计算范围，支持累计求和、移动平均等分析</li>\n<li>LAG/LEAD 实现环比、同比分析，LAST_VALUE 需显式指定 Frame 范围</li>\n<li>NAMED WINDOW 提升多窗口函数查询的可读性</li>\n<li>性能优化关键：为排序列建索引，合并相同窗口定义，控制分区大小</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"窗口函数","id":"窗口函数"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"排名函数","id":"排名函数"},{"level":2,"text":"聚合窗口函数","id":"聚合窗口函数"},{"level":2,"text":"偏移函数","id":"偏移函数"},{"level":2,"text":"NAMED WINDOW 与性能","id":"named-window-与性能"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"子查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/advanced-queries/subqueries"},"next":{"title":"CTE 与递归查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/advanced-queries/cte-and-recursive"}}